  "description": "Here in its disc brake version, the Falcon is a steel road frameset that combines performance, comfort and modernity. With its oversized steel tubes and its workshop-designed and built steel fork, it will easily accompany you on long mountain rides as well as ultra-distance races. Thanks to its modern geometry coupled with the well-known qualities of steel, this updated Falcon perfectly meets all your needs for versatility and performance. Its design has been rethought to incorporate the new UDH dropout standard, offer bigger tire clearance (up to 40mm as standard with 700c wheels, but up to 45mm in the custom version) and a completely unique fork design imagined and produced in our workshop to offer a 100% custom solution without relying on mass-produced models. When you choose the Falcon, you are choosing a frame that is as high-performance as it is unique, but also one that embodies exceptional craftsmanship and quality. Carefully handcrafted, each frameset is a one-of-a-kind piece that will set you apart from the rest of the pack.",
